Tailconnect
===========

This project is an independent implementation of a serverless Tailcat pair
tunnel. It is not affiliated with Tailscale Inc.

Third-party components used at runtime:

- github.com/tailscale/tailcat — BSD-3-Clause, Tailscale Inc.
- github.com/xtaci/smux — MIT.
- golang.org/x/crypto/argon2 — BSD-3-Clause, The Go Authors.

Design inspiration:

- hideouthq/hideout — GPL-3.0. The short-code idea, alphabet and region-residue
  technique were studied. No Hideout source code is copied into Tailconnect.
- OmarAlaaeldein/OpenTailcat — Apache-2.0. Used as an architectural reference
  for running Tailcat on Android. No OpenTailcat source code is copied into
  Tailconnect; this app contains no VpnService or VPN data plane.
